# Workspace (ai-alignment-literature)

This repository **is** the shared literature tree (theme folders at repo root, plus `bib.bib`). In multi-root Cursor workspaces, consumer repos use it as a **sister checkout** (same parent directory), not a nested `bibliography/` copy.

## Paths in agent chat

When citing files from **this** repository:

- **Always** prefix: `ai-alignment-literature/...`
- **Never** use bare paths like `alignment-faking/greenblatt2024alignment_faking-notes.md` — another root may have similar layout.

Consumers link here with filesystem relatives such as `../../ai-alignment-literature/...` (see each consumer’s **`LITERATURE.md`**).
